{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":637237,\"title\":\"Minds of Terror\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Three sick men are about to show the world what terror really means.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A86oVIWXSIAaNpo8urvr07laLRQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2003,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Mark Adams\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2426611,\"name\":\"Mark Adams\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":97823,\"name\":\"Joe Estevez\",\"character\":\"Kyle\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Ptl8apcuessOd2SpSYdt1lLcZl.jpg\"},{\"id\":97824,\"name\":\"Conrad Brooks\",\"character\":\"Doctor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccuggOAsOHthPN1kdhDbhH69Xwn.jpg\"},{\"id\":97805,\"name\":\"Robyn Griggs\",\"character\":\"Android Girl\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":98909,\"name\":\"Eric Spudic\",\"character\":\"Henry\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":97822,\"name\":\"Chris Watson\",\"character\":\"James (as Chuck Fonda)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":100022,\"name\":\"Len Kabasinski\",\"character\":\"Larry\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qavRkxdh7tL2XBk6jyPoHAFNtcM.jpg\"},{\"id\":4139744,\"name\":\"Randy Allen\",\"character\":\"Jeffrey Vandoren\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":84348,\"title\":\"V/H/S\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iB87cxOXa10ll3eXsLlZjRhM16j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xAC9kXLxUHpdCkISgYcLzYrxIQR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of misfits is hired by an unknown third party to burglarize a desolate house and acquire one rare VHS tape, they discover more found footage than they had bargained for.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23202,\"title\":\"Trick 'r Treat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w0nmol4g7n6MFfhfphV7GzHHYjB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7rPwe5T63MT9GfOct0be50pYdAL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":842033,\"title\":\"Ghost Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gLd1aJmAaNvLM8SwkD3cGVYIrTO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mGLBObg2JwEwRzsWYCVCunTlszo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A horror webtoon writer journeys to a shabby apartment building in search of ideas. The building's caretaker tells him about multiple strange events that happened throughout the building's history.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1373445,\"title\":\"V/H/S/Halloween\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bvMKSZtN8KAdtlKoYbEi1Zhyaou.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2JHJtATet58dzGpEwFek0kKGJFo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A collection of Halloween-themed videotapes unleashes a series of twisted, blood-soaked tales, turning trick-or-treat into a struggle for survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":753453,\"title\":\"V/H/S/94\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fSogEkqDfJQTuGHsTFloQz3Tw8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xSme7lQEliv4blGa3tjIgQs2g3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the discovery of a mysterious VHS tape, a brutish police SWAT team launches a high-intensity raid on a remote warehouse, only to discover a sinister cult compound whose collection of pre-recorded material uncovers a nightmarish conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":231001,\"title\":\"All Hallows' Eve\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSe8CBqK8HkbP6sqZWzcJfQV9Ci.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vIdqIpOsWspGoKoHnHncUOtJ7RZ.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While watching two children on Halloween night, a babysitter finds an old VHS tape in the kids' trick or treat bag. The tape features three tales of terror, all linked together by a murderous clown.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":159117,\"title\":\"V/H/S/2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o4hcWsHaHaNQ9BBReOxLvYJNRhA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aELgHEHFGDCcGslMoyg9KGiDV4v.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inside a darkened house looms a column of TVs littered with VHS tapes, a pagan shrine to forgotten analog gods. The screens crackle and pop endlessly with monochrome vistas of static white noise permeating the brain and fogging concentration. But you must fight the urge to relax: this is no mere movie night. Those obsolete spools contain more than just magnetic tape. They are imprinted with the very soul of evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":87436,\"title\":\"The ABCs of Death\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k3TcTGCgvvvhAiW9pkyWNz9CoNN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f3iqPpYcEOWEjVsEHqM1vFRdPhp.jpg\",\"rating\":4.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ambitious anthology film featuring segments directed by over two dozen of the world's leading talents in contemporary genre film. Inspired by children's educational ABC books, the film comprises 26 individual chapters, each helmed by a different director assigned a letter of the alphabet. The directors were then given free reign in choosing a word to create a story involving death.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354251,\"title\":\"Southbound\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ehXtB1jlMx8FBlsX9JLhSQkvlZp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31H6hObnaYoavamfzm2DWu7ofhc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a desolate stretch of desert highway, weary travelers — two men on the run from their past, a band on their way to the next gig, a man struggling to get home, a brother in search of his long-lost sister and a family on vacation — are forced to confront their worst fears and darkest secrets in these interwoven tales of terror and remorse on the open road.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1241624,\"title\":\"Ghost Train\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rOTXYy5ScOHdaC2YMQowVwQex5s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tIelKFZsCHcL9s9JY0M6b0FfYiX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Da-kyung, a horror YouTuber desperate for views, uploads a video about the eerie urban legends surrounding Gwanglim Station—the site of the highest number of missing person cases in the country. The video goes viral overnight. Despite everyone's warnings, Da-kyung's thirst for views only grows stronger. But as she digs deeper, she uncovers a shocking secret behind the station…\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":715123,\"title\":\"Books of Blood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bXLVZGgLgd7OwbfP6fC5GCfrxuD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6qb2h3dT1tb0zkhktD5r7ZHbmp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A journey into uncharted and forbidden territory through three tales tangled in space and time. A desperate woman, a skeptical professor, and a ruthless killer face unspeakable forces.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":524216,\"title\":\"The Mortuary Collection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5WXeYnezavNI6hXH74aQYv6yFzj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsGSTBl5H8DBLnHc24Teny0Ppc5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the phantasmagorical town of Raven's End, a misguided young girl takes refuge in a decrepit old mortuary. The eccentric undertaker chronicles the strange history of the town through a series of twisted tales, each more terrifying than the last, but the young girl's world is unhinged when she discovers that the final story... is her own.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"9hbDnEbR_3E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ETaTp6uquEc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YlGUTEIRovQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}